OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council announces
OL,4,Aplans for up to 12,000 more homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 12,000 new homes could be built
OL,7,Fin Glasgow after the city council
OL,8,Fannounced plans to invest hundreds of
OL,9,Fmillions of pounds into tackling the
OL,10,Fcity's housing emergency.
OL,12,FGlasgow has been in a "housing
OL,13,Femergency" since 2023, with heavy
OL,14,Fpressure on the city's homelessness
OL,15,Fservices, with the rising cost of the
OL,16,Fproblem affecting the city's overall
OL,17,Fbudget.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
