OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council announces
OL,4,Aplans for up to 12,000 more homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have now passed plans to
OL,7,Finvest #674m into creating a confirmed
OL,8,F6,500 affordable houses, along with a
OL,9,Fpipeline for thousands more if further
OL,10,Ffunding becomes available.
OL,12,FThe initiative identified 59 sites
OL,13,Facross Glasgow as potential locations
OL,14,Ffor a maximum 12,173 new homes, to be
OL,15,Fbuilt between 2027 and 2032.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
